    "grade": "8",
    "points": 6,
    "timeMinutes": null,
    "type": "mc",
    "prompt": "In the subtraction question $$\\begin{array}{r} 1957 \\\\ -\\;\\; a9 \\\\ \\hline 18b8 \\end{array}$$ the sum of the digits $a$ and $b$ is",
    "image": null,
    "choices": [
      {
        "key": "A",
        "text": "15"
      },
      {
        "key": "B",
        "text": "14"
      },
      {
        "key": "C",
        "text": "10"
      },
      {
        "key": "D",
        "text": "5"
      },
      {
        "key": "E",
        "text": "4"
      }
    ],
    "answer": "B",
    "acceptedAnswers": null,
    "answerUnit": null,
    "solutions": [
      {
        "title": "Turn it into an addition",
        "body": "Check the subtraction by adding: $18b8 + a9 = 1957$.\n\n- Ones: $8 + 9 = 17$, write $7$, carry $1$.\n- Tens: $b + a + 1$ must end in $5$, and the hundreds column then needs $8 + \\text{carry} = 9$, so the carry is $1$ and $b + a + 1 = 15$.\n\nSo $a + b = 14$.\n\n**Answer: (B) 14**"
      },
      {
        "title": "Find an example",
        "body": "Try $a = 8$: $1957 - 89 = 1868$, so $b = 6$ and $a + b = 14$. (Other values also fit, e.g. $1957 - 79 = 1878$ gives $7 + 7 = 14$; the sum is always $14$.)\n\n**Answer: (B) 14**"
      }
    ],
    "topics": [
      "arithmetic",
      "logic"
    ],
